{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06550","headline":"题应圣观 · 储光羲","name":"题应圣观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空中望小山，山下见余雪。\n皎皎河汉女，在兹养真骨。\n登门骇天书，啓龠问仙诀。\n池光摇水雾，灯色连松月。\n合甎起花台，折草成玉节。\n天鸡弄白羽，王母垂玄发。\n北有上年宫，一路在云霓。\n上心方向道，时复朝金阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}